The combined bold-italic token does not open after an underscore or a slash

```
a_/*y*/ x
.
<p>a_/<strong>y</strong>/ x</p>
```

```
//*y*/ x
.
<p>//<strong>y</strong>/ x</p>
```

```
see snake_/*glob*/ now
.
<p>see snake_/<strong>glob</strong>/ now</p>
```

```
_/*x*/_
.
<p><u><strong><em>x</em></strong></u></p>
```
